# Safe Iteration Checks

When making substantive changes, complete these checks:

- Run compile validation for edited Python files.
- Check lints for edited files.
- Confirm no regressions in startup layout for all UI modes.
- Confirm primary actions remain visible and usable.
- Confirm no new freeze/crash path during resize and normal operation.

Communication standard:
- Report what changed, what was verified, and any remaining risk.
- If uncertainty remains, propose the smallest next safeguard patch.
